### APPLICATIONS

### Get all applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

### Get application by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/6ab3e572a6c146c62293f403

### Create application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "userId": "65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1",
  "companyId": "65f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d5",
  "jobTitle": "Web Services Developer",
  "location": "Guatemala City, Guatemala",
  "applicationDate": "2026-09-25",
  "status": "Offer",
  "jobType": "Full-time",
  "salaryRange": "Q12,000 - Q16,000 mensual",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/job/web-services-dev",
  "notes": "Oferta recibida, evaluando condiciones."
}

